        "index": 1,
        "text": "As the director stated on behalf of his research group, the data of this graph makes a clear presentation of the future environmental tendency. On the one hand, the quantity of fuel keeps on decreasing by 9% per year while the growth of a wide range of pollution has been a global trend. On the other hand, the mild but steady rise in the average temperature is resulting in catastrophes like widespread floods.",
        "zh": "正如负责人代表研究小组所说，这幅图的数据清楚地展示了，未来环境变化的趋势。一方面，燃料数量正以每年9%的速度持续减少，而多种污染的加剧已经成为全球趋势。另一方面，平均气温缓慢而持续地上升，正导致大范围洪灾等灾难。",
